class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0164c575eca36621\" href=\"?note=0164c575eca36621\" title=\"43-df-effective-box-cover\">43-df-effective-box-cover</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\underline{\\dim}_{\\mathrm B}^{\\mathrm{eff}}(X):=\\inf\\{\\liminf_{n\\to\\infty,\\,n&gt;0}\\tfrac{\\log_2\\max\\{1,|D[n]|\\}}n:D\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\mathrm{EffectiveBoxCover}(D,X)\\}.\n\\qquad\\overline{\\dim}_{\\mathrm B}^{\\mathrm{eff}}(X):=\\inf\\{\\limsup_{n\\to\\infty,\\,n&gt;0}\\tfrac{\\log_2\\max\\{1,|D[n]|\\}}n:D\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\mathrm{EffectiveBoxCover}(D,X)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\underline{\\dim}_{\\mathrm B}^{\\mathrm{eff}}(X):=\\inf\\{\\liminf_{n\\to\\infty,\\,n&gt;0}\\tfrac{\\log_2\\max\\{1,|D[n]|\\}}n:D\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\mathrm{EffectiveBoxCover}(D,X)\\}.\n\\qquad\\overline{\\dim}_{\\mathrm B}^{\\mathrm{eff}}(X):=\\inf\\{\\limsup_{n\\to\\infty,\\,n&gt;0}\\tfrac{\\log_2\\max\\{1,|D[n]|\\}}n:D\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\mathrm{EffectiveBoxCover}(D,X)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>候选 D=2^{&lt;ω} 保证下确界集合非空。晚于覆盖阈值的每层非空，max{1,·}只消除无关有限初段中的log0。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-effective-box-cover","status":"resolved","id":"0164c575eca36621","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effective-box-cover]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-box-cover","status":"resolved","id":"0164c575eca36621","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{EffectiveBoxCover}$、$D[n]$ 见 [[43-df-effective-box-cover]]。","embed":